cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Anomalous scaling limit of a Brownian particle in a log-correlated potential"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/nitromannitol/subdiffusive-process"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the scaling limit of a
  Brownian particle in a log-correlated random potential, of the quantitative
  homogenization of the associated elliptic operators, and of their anomalous
  large-scale Hölder regularity. The theorems hold for every random environment
  satisfying the standing assumptions of the paper. The library contains no sorry
  and no custom axiom, and each of Theorems A, B and C has a Mathlib-only comparator
  challenge.
authors:
